//   4. 0003-file-format.oot — Academy header, 256 cap, ASD-STE100.
//   5. 0004-engineering-model.oot — the 3-layer architecture and E-M formulation.
//   6. 0005-tactical-subsystem-template.oot — the template every subsystem follows.

